		)
		(uuid "90addada-7a9e-5dab-ba28-6209d0916333")
	)
	(text "VSS pads 3, 5,\n10 and 12 are\nbonded down\nonto tongues of\nthe ground land\n(pad 15).\nLO and RF are\nprobed, not\nbonded."
